      "title": "Resources",
      "description": "Handshake Disclaimer & Employer Policies | Wellesley Career Education Skip to main content MyWellesley Give Handshake Hive Events ELR Getting Started Employers Faculty Parents About Career Advising Career Exploration Arts, Media, & Technology Business, Consulting, Finance, & Marketing Communication, Education, Government, & International Affairs​ Health Professions Advising Pre-Law Advising Science, Public Health, & Behavioral Health Career Essentials Resources Drop-ins & Peer Career Mentors Graduate School Internships Policies Application Support Short Internship Projects (SHIPs) Wellesley-funded Internships & Grants FAQs Fellowships Fellowships for Undergraduates Fellowships for Graduates Class of 2027 Fellowship Planning Fellowships for International Students Fellowships Browser Civic Engagement Ministrare Peer Leader Office Hours Alumnae BEAM Entrepreneurship Advising Make It Make Cents Wellesley in Business Symposium Resources Career Advising Career Exploration Arts, Media, & Technology Business, Consulting, Finance, & Marketing Communication, Education, Government, & International Affairs​ Health Professions Advising Pre-Law Advising Science, Public Health, & Behavioral Health Career Essentials Resources Drop-ins & Peer Career Mentors Graduate School Internships Policies Application Support Short Internship Projects (SHIPs) Wellesley-funded Internships & Grants FAQs Fellowships Fellowships for Undergraduates Fellowships for Graduates Class of 2027 Fellowship Planning Fellowships for International Students Fellowships Browser Civic Engagement Ministrare Peer Leader Office Hours Alumnae BEAM Entrepreneurship Advising Make It Make Cents Wellesley in Business Symposium Handshake Hive Events Deadlines Resources Recruit About Home Handshake Disclaimer & Employer Policies Kate Rettstadt Director, Employer Engagement More from Kate Ingrid Belete Núñez '90 Assistant Director, Employer Engagement More from Ingrid Additional Employer-Related Policies The Lulu Chow Wang ‘66 Center for Career Education uses Handshake for posting full-time, part-time and internship positions, as well as external employer/fellowship foundation/graduate school virtual and in-person events. Inclusion of these opportunities and/or events in the platform does not signify a recommendation, sponsorship, or endorsement. Career Education explicitly makes no representations or guarantees about externa opportunities and events, or the accuracy of the information provided by an employer/fellowship foundation/graduate school. Career Education is not responsible for safety, wages, working conditions, or any other aspect of off-campus employment. It is the responsibility of each student or alum to perform their due diligence in researching the facts and reputation of organizations when applying for or accepting private, off-campus employment. Students and alums should be prudent and use common sense and caution when applying for or accepting any position, and participating in an external event. Both students and alums are encouraged to report any concerns or questions to: recruiting@wellesley.edu . Additional Employer-Related Policies Campus Recruiting Program Policies (Employers) Off-Campus Employment, Caregiving, and Home-Based Services Policy #recruit More from Kate More from Ingrid Let’s Talk Contact T. (781) 283-2352 careereducation@wellesley.edu Modulars 400 ( temporary for 2025-2026) 106 Central Street Wellesley, MA 02481 Career Education is available for virtual and in-person appointments . Employers: please visit our recruiting landing page and email recruiting@wellesley.edu with questions. Handshake Disclaimer & Employer Policies Copyright © Trustees of Wellesley College Terms of Use Privacy Policy Press Donate to the Program Handshake Hive Instagram Facebook Linkedin"
